{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2021-12-20 06:00:00', 'title': 'STATE STREET AND LSEG EXPAND RELATIONSHIP', 'text': 'BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--STATE STREET CORPORATION (NYSE:STT) AND LONDON STOCK EXCHANGE GROUP (LSE:LSEG), TODAY ANNOUNCED THEIR AGREEMENT TO EXTEND THEIR RELATIONSHIP. BUILDING ON THEIR LONGSTANDING RELATIONSHIP, THE AGREEMENT INCLUDES A WIDE RANGE OF CAPABILITIES TO SUPPORT STATE STREET ACROSS ITS BUSINESS, ENHANCING ITS OFFERINGS TO CLIENTS. “STATE STREET HAS BEEN A VALUED CLIENT OF BOTH FTSE RUSSELL AND REFINITIV FOR MANY YEARS AND WE ARE EXCITED TO EXTEND OUR COLLABORATION,” SAID ANDREA REMY'}